        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9040, Large Ridged Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Large Traditional Ridged Cabinet Pull is a great way to add classic beauty to your home. This Large Ridged Cabinet Pull is available in 12 inch or 18 inch center to center mounting lengths. Choose from a wide array of traditional finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/traditional-ridged-cabinet-pull-omnia-9040\"><b>Smaller Traditional Ridged Cabinet Pull</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/traditional-ridged-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-9040\"><b>Traditional Ridged Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ridged Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>OMN-9040/305</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>OMN-9040/458</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-25/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed this in a smaller size? <a href=\"/products/traditional-ridged-cabinet-pull-omnia-9040\"><b>click here</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lion-head-door-stop.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"514\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
